      "text": "Over 8 days, walk the forest trails of the southern Amazon, swim among fish in the clear waters of Bom Jardim and see the sandstone cliffs of Chapada dos Guimarães. Spend the final three nights in the Northern Pantanal, with canoeing, horseback rides, observation towers and a night safari.",
